    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n14800" root="رج" body-key="r">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِجْرِجٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِجْرِجَةٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Slaver,</i> or <i>drivel.</i>
(TA. [See, again, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِجْرِجَةٌ</span>.]) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَآءُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرِيسٍ</span> [app. meaning The <i>fluid of the gelatinous
substance termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَرِيس</span>, <i>prepared from fish</i> &amp;c.].
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  And <i>Crumbled,</i> or <i>broken, bread,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَرِيد</span>,)
<i>made soft with grease,</i> or <i>gravy:</i> (TA:) and
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رِجْرِجَةٌ</span></b>  [as its n. un.] signifies <i>a mess of such
bread</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَرِيدَةٌ</span>) <i>so made soft;</i> (Sudot;;) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ثَرِيدَةٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">رَجْرَاجَةٌ</span> [signifies the same, or] <i>a mess of such

bread made soft and compact.</i> (TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  Also,
[said in the K and TA to be like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قِلْقِلٌ</span>, but in the
CK like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فُلْفُلٌ</span>,] <i>A certain plant.</i> (S, K.)

